  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "1. Dissolve ingredients (except sulfur, carbonate, vitamins, growth-stimulating factors and Na-dithionite), boil medium for 1 min, then cool to room temperature under 80% H2 and 20% CO2 gas atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Adjust pH to 6.0 and dispense under 80% H2 and 20% CO2 gas atmosphere into anoxic Hungate-type tubes or serum vials which contain already the appropriate amount of sulfur, only to 30% of their volume to allow for a large head space."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Autoclave at a temperature of 110°C for 20 min! Add vitamins, growth-stimulating factors from sterile anoxic stock solutions prepared under 100% N2 gas and carbonate and Na-dithionite from sterile anoxic stock solutions prepared under 80% N2 and 20% CO2 gas atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Vitamins and dithionite are sterilized by filtration. Adjust pH of the complete medium to 6.0, if necessary."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "2. After inoculation use 1 bar overpressure of sterile 80% H2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "Dissolve ingredients, adjust pH to 9.0 with NaOH, then autoclave under 100% N2 gas."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "comment": "First dissolve FeCl2 in the HCl, then dilute in water, add and dissolve the other salts. Finally make up to 1000.0 ml."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "comment": "Dissolve NaHCO3 in water and make the solution anoxic by sparging with 80% N2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "comment": "Then dissolve the Na-dithionite and filter sterilize the solution into anoxic Hungate tubes."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "comment": "Store the prepared solution in the dark and refrigerated. Prepare only small amounts of stock solution, as Na-dithionite decomposes rapidly."
    }
  ]
}